  "_about": "an Indian peacock walking with his train: a pheasant's body on grey-brown legs -- cobalt-blue neck and breast, the back bronze-green and scaled, the folded wing barred buff and black over dark secondaries -- a small blue head with the white face stripes and the fan of blue-tipped crest shafts; over the rump the domed mass of the train's bases, and the TRAIN itself: tiers of bronze-green feathers each ending in its eye and fringe, sloping down from the rump to the ground and trailing along it for half its length, the eyes scattered over it like scales (each tier its own length, the shorter laid over the longer); `display` (variants.display) raises it into the upright fan, a wall of eyes",
